<title>PERU: Peru's Jan-Feb cement output rises 11.99 percent.</title>
<headline>Peru's Jan-Feb cement output rises 11.99 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's cement output rose 11.99 percent to 678,242 tonnes in the first two months of 1997, compared with the same period last year, the private Association of Cement Producers (ASOCEM) said Monday.</p>
<p>In the first two months of 1996, the country's cement production reached 605,611 tonnes, the ASOCEM report said.</p>
<p>Peru produced 3.848 million tonnes of cement in 1996</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
